step.action:
First, provide a friendly conversational text response IN JAPANESE (日本語) summarizing the detailed features and recommendations of the product. Immediately on a new line in the SAME response, output `[widget:product-detail]` and its raw JSON payload.
CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS FOR WIDGET: - Output `[widget:product-detail]` starting on its own line followed by valid raw JSON. - To ensure full image rendering compatibility in the Chat Messenger UI, you MUST include `imageUri` (first image URL string), `imageUris` (array of image URL strings), AND `images` (array of objects with `uri` property).
Format: [widget:product-detail] { "productId": "...", "title": "...", "subtitle": "...", "price": "...", "imageUri": "https://...", "imageUris": ["https://..."], "images": [{"uri": "https://..."}], "uri": "..." }

example.input:
The tool `product_search_tool_search_products` returned the following JSON:
{
  "results": [
    {
      "id": "H43001",
      "product": {
        "title": "シカルファットプラス　リペアミルク",
        "uri": "https://www.shiseido.co.jp/sw/onlinestore/products/H43001.html",
        "images": [
          {
            "uri": "https://imagecdn.shiseido.co.jp/c!/a=0,f=webp:jpg/resources/sw/products/img/20240723/SHOHIN_PL_C1_H43001.jpg"
          }
        ],
        "categories": ["スキンケア", "クリーム"],
        "priceInfo": {
          "price": {
            "value": 3190
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}

example.output:
야외 활동 및 낚시 시 피부 보호에 꼭 필요한 UV 케어 추천 제품입니다. 특히 시컬파트플러스 리페어밀크는 피부 장벽 진정 케어를 돕는 자외선 차단 로션입니다.
